  "title": "Mini Lead",
  "description": "Minimoog-style mono lead: 3 oscillators + noise, 24 dB lowpass, two contours, glide and vibrato",
  "longDescription": "Osc 1 saw, Osc 2 saw +7 cents, Osc 3 square one octave down, pink noise, all into a 4-input mixer and a 24 dB lowpass. Loudness Contour shapes the oscillator amplitudes, Filter Contour sweeps the cutoff (250 Hz - 7 kHz). Mono with glide; a slow triangle LFO adds light vibrato to Osc 1 and 2. Osc 3 has no vibrato, so it can sit one octave below via Tune.",
